# refund-ui environment variables
# Copy to .env.local and fill in values for local development.
# Never commit .env.local or any file with real secrets.

# refund-ui has no direct backend / auth calls of its own today (T15,
# specs/003-suite-shell) — authenticated calls go through the shared
# `shell/session` module (VITE_AUTH_URL / VITE_API_URL live in shell/.env.example,
# not here). Nothing to configure yet; kept as a placeholder so the file
# exists for the next env var this app needs (e.g. a future refund-api URL).
